  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:08:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:08:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hello, good afternoon. I think I have the wrong number. I am looking for the electric company, to report the power is out. On my street, the lights, they went off after the rain started."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:08:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. No, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. We're not the electric utility. They'd have their own outage line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I understand. I am calling from an old list, you know, I have it on paper in my drawer. Maybe the list is older than me. [pause] I laugh, but my feet are cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it happens. Best bet is to look on a recent bill or the utility's website for the outage number. Your bill should have it printed right on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the bill, yes, I will find it. Thank you for being patient with me, Mister Owen. I must go soon anyway, I am substitute crossing guard today, I have to be at the corner for the school children."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:09:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you stay warm out there, and watch the slush. Good luck with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:09:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
